msgstr "Paldies, ka izvēlējāties Password Pusher!"

#: ../../../app/views/users/sessions/otp.html.erb:4
msgid "Enter the 6-digit code from your authenticator app or a backup code."
msgstr "Ievadiet 6 ciparu kodu no autentifikācijas lietotnes vai rezerves kodu."

#: ../../../app/views/users/sessions/otp.html.erb:8
#: ../../../app/views/users/two_factor/verify.html.erb:19
msgid "Code"
msgstr "Kods"

#: ../../../app/views/users/sessions/otp.html.erb:9
#: ../../../app/views/users/two_factor/verify.html.erb:20
msgid "Verification code"
msgstr "Verifikācijas kods"

#: ../../../app/views/users/sessions/otp.html.erb:11
msgid "Verify"
msgstr "Pārbaudīt"

#: ../../../app/views/users/two_factor/_mfa_required_banner.html.erb:3
msgid ""
"Two-factor authentication is required by the administrator. You must complete "
"setup to access the application."
msgstr ""
"Administrators pieprasa divfaktoru autentifikāciju. Lai piekļūtu lietojumprogr"
"ammai, ir jāpabeidz iestatīšana."

#: ../../../app/views/users/two_factor/backup_codes.html.erb:1
#: ../../../app/views/users/two_factor/backup_codes.html.erb:6
msgid "Save your backup codes"
msgstr "Saglabājiet savus rezerves kodus"

#: ../../../app/views/users/two_factor/backup_codes.html.erb:12
msgid ""
"Store these codes in a safe place. Each can be used once if you lose your auth"
"enticator device."
msgstr ""
"Glabājiet šos kodus drošā vietā. Katru no tiem var izmantot vienu reizi, ja pa"
"zaudējat autentifikācijas ierīci."

#: ../../../app/views/users/two_factor/backup_codes.html.erb:17
msgid "Save or copy these codes now"
msgstr "Saglabājiet vai kopējiet šos kodus tūlīt"

#: ../../../app/views/users/two_factor/backup_codes.html.erb:18
msgid ""
"You will not be able to see this list again after you continue. If you lose yo"
"ur device and your backup codes, you may need an administrator to reset your a"
"ccount."
msgstr ""
"Pēc turpināšanas šo sarakstu vairs nevarēsiet redzēt. Ja pazaudēsiet ierīci un"
" rezerves kodus, iespējams, jūsu konts būs jāatiestata administratoram."

#: ../../../app/views/users/two_factor/backup_codes.html.erb:24
msgid "Recovery codes"
msgstr "Atkopšanas kodi"

#: ../../../app/views/users/two_factor/backup_codes.html.erb:25
msgid "total"
msgstr "kopā"

#: ../../../app/views/users/two_factor/backup_codes.html.erb:41
#: ../../../app/views/users/two_factor/backup_codes.html.erb:42
msgid "Copy all codes"
msgstr "Kopēt visus kodus"

#: ../../../app/views/users/two_factor/backup_codes.html.erb:46
msgid ""
"Backup codes are saved but can only be shown once. If you did not save them, d"
"isable two-factor authentication and set it up again."
msgstr ""
"Rezerves kodi ir saglabāti, bet tos var parādīt tikai vienu reizi. Ja tos nesa"
"glabājāt, atspējojiet divfaktoru autentifikāciju un iestatiet to vēlreiz."

#: ../../../app/views/users/two_factor/backup_codes.html.erb:52
msgid "Continue to verify"
msgstr "Turpināt verifikāciju"

#: ../../../app/views/users/two_factor/verify.html.erb:1
msgid "Verify authenticator"
msgstr "Verificēt autentifikatoru"

#: ../../../app/views/users/two_factor/verify.html.erb:6
msgid "Scan this QR code"
msgstr "Skenējiet šo QR kodu"

#: ../../../app/views/users/two_factor/verify.html.erb:10
msgid ""
"Add this account to your authenticator app, then enter the 6-digit code to con"
"firm."
msgstr ""
"Pievienojiet šo kontu autentifikācijas lietotnei un pēc tam ievadiet 6 ciparu "
"kodu, lai apstiprinātu."

#: ../../../app/views/users/two_factor/verify.html.erb:14
msgid "If you cannot scan the code, enter this secret manually:"
msgstr "Ja nevarat noskenēt kodu, ievadiet šo slepeno atslēgu manuāli:"

#: ../../../app/views/users/two_factor/verify.html.erb:23
msgid "Enable two-factor authentication"
msgstr "Iespējot divfaktoru autentifikāciju"

#: ../../../lib/pwpush/generator/charsets.rb:27
msgid "Character set is empty."
msgstr "Rakstzīmju kopa ir tukša."

#: ../../../lib/pwpush/generator/charsets.rb:39
msgid "Select at least one character class."
msgstr "Atlasiet vismaz vienu rakstzīmju klasi."

#: ../../../lib/pwpush/generator/passphrase.rb:16
msgid "Separator is too long."
msgstr "Atdalītājs ir pārāk garš."

#: ../../../lib/pwpush/generator/password.rb:64
msgid "Password length is too short for the selected character rules."
msgstr "Parole ir pārāk īsa, ņemot vērā izvēlētos rakstzīmju noteikumus."

